{
  "dom_id": "step-72832",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Evaluating Expressions Containing Parentheses",
  "problem": "What is the value of $\\left( -3 + 6 \\right) \\div \\dfrac{4}{3} - \\dfrac{1}{4}?$",
  "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we perform the operation inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3+6)÷\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ 3÷\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we divide:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3÷\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ (3÷\\frac{4}{3})-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ (\\frac{3}{1}÷\\frac{4}{3})-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ (\\frac{3}{1}\\times \\frac{3}{4})-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{3\\times 3}{1\\times 4}-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{9}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we subtract:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9}{4}-\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{9-1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{8}{4} & = \\\\ 8÷4 & = \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-72832\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"72832\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12834\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-72832\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-14\">Evaluating Expressions Containing Parentheses</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"72832\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                    